  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: '<size=24>Appears on all reels and substitutes for all symbols. '
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: <size=24>All symbols in win combinations disappear and empty symbol positions
      are filled as symbols tumble from above, allowing for consecutive wins during
      one spin.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: '<size=24>Appears only during Collapsing Mystery Feature.

      3 or more



      triggers Shining Free Games.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: "<size=24>When all symbols in winning combinations disappears as part of
      Collapsing Reels, each empty position may award one of the following before
      the reel collapsing:\r\n- Coin Prizes\r\n- Free Games Symbol\r\n- Explosive
      Wild  Symbol\r\n- Collectible Element"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_5
    value: "<size=24>Once all 5 different collectible gems are collected, the Perfect
      Jewel Bonus will be triggered.\r\nComplete Jewel sets and win prizes accordingly."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_6
    value: "<size=24>Appears only during Collapsing Mystery Feature.\r\nWhen it appears,
      it cascades with other symbols and turns itself and at most up to 5 random symbols
      into Wilds."
